  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">HETQ Investigative Journalists 2023-2026 - HETQ Investigative Journalists</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">HETQ Unders&#xf6;kande Journalister - Armenien 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to reduce corruption in Armenia by revealing mechanisms of corruption and contributing to development of effective mechanisms to fight corruption, to improve the work of anti-corruption bodies by showing their shortcomings and gaps, to highlight existing problems in the field of human rights protection and help relevant bodies to solve them. 

Objective 1. To contribute to the transparent and accountable governance through corruption reporting.

Objective 2. To contribute to the protection of human rights through reporting the violations of these rights.

Objective 3. Enhance professional capacities of thirty young journalists in investigative reporting.

Objective 4. To stimulate public discussion about corruption, human rights, and the rule of law.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let med projektet &#xe4;r att minska korruptionen i Armenien genom att avsl&#xf6;ja korruptionsmekanismer och bidra till utvecklingen av effektiva mekanismer f&#xf6;r att bek&#xe4;mpa korruption, att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra arbetet i anti-korruptionsorgan genom att visa deras brister och luckor, f&#xf6;r att belysa befintliga problem p&#xe5; omr&#xe5;det m&#xe4;nskliga r&#xe4;ttigheter och hj&#xe4;lpa relevanta organ att l&#xf6;sa dem.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the project is to reduce corruption in Armenia by revealing mechanisms of corruption and contributing to development of effective mechanisms to fight corruption, to improve the work of anti-corruption bodies by showing their shortcomings and gaps, to highlight existing problems in the field of human rights protection and help relevant bodies to solve them.</narrative>
  </description>
